      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MOSS-Image Base, 8 steps (DMD2 LoRA)\n\nThe 8-step **DMD2 LoRA** of [lodestones/Kromoss](https://huggingface.co/lodestones/Kromoss) is distilled from MOSS-Image\nBase (rank 128). It also works on Kromoss (`kromoss_bf16.safetensors`, a drop-in replacement for the diffusion model);\non SFT it is untested. Use one DMD LoRA at a time, and do not merge it into bf16 weights.\n\n**Settings**: 8 steps (4 also works), CFG 1, euler, simple, 1024×1024. Shift 5 is applied by the model. The negative\nconditioning is zeroed: at CFG 1 there is no negative pass, so the Generate tab shows no negative prompt, and Skip\nLayer Guidance is left out (it needs the negative pass). **CFG above 1 burns the image.**\n\n**Prompts**: natural language, booru-style tags or a JSON layout (paste it into the prompt; its size must match\nWidth / Height). Put text to render in double quotes; `(word:1.2)` weights are not known to work.\n\n## Image Bench\n\n| Marker | Node | Generate tab |\n|--------|------|--------------|\n| `ib:cp` | Load Diffusion Model | model list, model exploration |\n| `ib:pp` | Image Bench Prompt | prompt and LoRA list |\n| `ib:smp` | KSampler | seed, steps, CFG scale, sampling method, schedule type |\n| `ib:lora` | Load LoRA (bypassed) | LoRA exploration only |\n\n**LoRAs**: check them in the LoRA list or type `<lora:name:weight>` into the prompt; they add to the DMD2 LoRA, which\nis not marked and stays on. **Load LoRA** stays bypassed; LoRA exploration enables it for its runs.\n\nMOSS-Image needs a ComfyUI with native support (merged 16 Oct 2026, PR #17095; master after 0.41.x): an older\ninstall fails to load the model. The CLIP loader type must be `moss_image`.\n\n## Model Links\n\n[Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image) also has `*_int8_convrot` diffusion models (5.4 GB,\nfor 16 GB VRAM or less) and the `qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq` text encoder (7.3 GB).\n\n**diffusion_models**: [moss_image_sft_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/moss_image_sft_bf16.safetensors), [moss_image_base_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/moss_image_base_bf16.safetensors)\n**text_encoders**: [qwen3.5_9b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3.5_9b_int8_convrot.safetensors) (one file for SFT and Base)\n**vae**: [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors) (the FLUX.2 VAE)\n**loras**: [8-steps-dmd2-lora.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/lodestones/Kromoss/resolve/main/8-steps-dmd2-lora.safetensors)\n"
      ],
      "title": "Note: MOSS-Image Base, 8 steps"
    }
